		{
			dependencies: ["594A3B3C9462F128"]
			description: [
				"反应堆的&#D2691E核燃料&r只能通过&#D2691E装配线&r制作，配方有2种变体。"
				""
				"“基础”配方以 1:1 的比例提供燃料，将 &#D2691E钍&r 转化为 &#D2691E核燃料&r。虽然效率不高，但至少能让你在几乎没有 &#D2691E辐射&r 风险的情况下为反应堆供电。"
				""
				"  The &#D2691Eradiation&r effects experienced      due to mistakes at this point are very   minimalist compared to what you are      probably used to. It can be negated     by a full set of leather armor, and if   the reactor were to be \"unsealed\" the  effects of radiation will dissipate once  re-sealed."
				""
				"  The \"improved\" recipe converts         &#D2691Eirradium&r into &#D2691Enuclear fuel&r at a 1:12      ratio. HOWEVER, this comes with the       added trade off of producing             radioactive nuclear waste in the          process. The &#D2691Eradiation&r caused by this  waste is &o&nEXACTLY&r&r what you are used    to, it will irradiate the environment       killing anything in its vicinity and          dissipates VERY slowly. Be very           careful handling and processing this    waste, releasing enough of it at once   will effectively \"kill\" a base and           render it unusable. "
				"&#D2691E&l***************************************&r"
				"如果你不熟悉核废料管理，强烈建议将这些设施建在独立的环境中。远离你珍视的一切事物……"
				"&#D2691E&l***************************************&r"
				"&n&#D2691E&l警告&r&r"
			]
			hide_until_deps_visible: true
			id: "5057087F615D440F"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
